From 7dcc9a1d6138260cb123acc41d9a863bbf4f5e3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:42:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): provider overlay on a configured install no
 longer overwrites the default model [daveey]

requestDesktopOnboarding() (credential failure) opens the overlay with
manual:false, and completeWithModelConfirm pre-persisted the recommended
default before the confirm card, so 'I've signed in' flipped
gpt-6-astra to claude-sonnet-5 and dismissing kept it. Pre-persist now only
on a genuine first run (no main model configured). Otherwise the confirm
card defers every write (Change pick, Begin, local/custom endpoint) and says
Begin changes the default for new chats; dismiss writes nothing.
